                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "playing this game i learnt you need a lot of arm strength, it was great to be whizzing around the track at high speed in a wheel chair. when i play games i look for something unique and this offers that.  \nnot the most visually stunning VR game but dont let that put you off you will soon forget the visuals as you focus on mastering the art of getting round the course as fast as you can to get on the leader board. \nIts not going to break the bank, Will give you a work out and also an opportunity to experience what its like to be in a wheelchair. \nWell done the devs \n",
